# Keep source files LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks Go files out as CRLF and `gofmt -l`
# flags every one of them, even though they are correctly formatted. That makes
# the "gofmt clean" build gate unmeetable on Windows and trains people to ignore
# a real signal.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
